@AGENTS.md

## Claude Code specifics

- Skills live in `.agents/skills/`; `.claude/skills` is a symlink to it
  (`uv run poe setup` repairs it on Windows checkouts without symlinks).
- `KB_ACTOR` is set in `.claude/settings.json`, so `uv run kb new` fills
  `generated.by`. Update it there when the model changes.
- Hooks: after each Write/Edit in `{{ bundle_dir }}/`, the edited file is
  validated; after each Bash command, so are the pages it created or
  changed. On stop, every page this session changed must pass `kb check`,
  the indexes above them must be fresh, and knowledge edits need a new
  `log.md` entry. Hook output tells you exactly what to fix; run
  `uv run poe check` for the whole bundle.
- `.env` holds secrets: reading it, with a file tool or a shell command, is
  denied. `kb` loads it when it needs a key.
